{"title":"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Estimate)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Estimate)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What time was it <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efe8f67ac18da14c8aa767b8131b0650ac9b9720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2011$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> minutes after midnight on January 1, 2011? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd2f2fc8c8612c63277c7154e5c9c9b674d5519.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{January 1 at 9:31PM}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"189\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/b/aebce7d8e8ccb039d16a29954b436615c901f87f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{January 1 at 11:51PM}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"198\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/c/f5ceb15e68ea2a51d7224c2e91106adb389fea03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{January 2 at 3:11AM}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"189\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/5/52597258d5b5d881fe8a529b824fa7861901cbe5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{January 2 at 9:31AM}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/790e39821a01095717530584034ce7f2defa9e11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{January 2 at 6:01PM}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"187\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes in an hour. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/8/308ddd0221628146b7ab656cd7088e885fa0fe77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2011/60=33\\text{r}31,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6f3bccae16d5e31266370fced24edc41538d5da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> hours and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/6/296fac336caaa4265aa24b6ecbc408a348ad7e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> hours in a day, so the time is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/6/296fac336caaa4265aa24b6ecbc408a348ad7e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes after midnight on January 2, 2011. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/4/5448a3e0374955ad2ce64b4081f36d5da604fba8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\text{ January 2 at 9:31AM}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"225\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like the previous solution, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efe8f67ac18da14c8aa767b8131b0650ac9b9720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2011$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> minutes is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6f3bccae16d5e31266370fced24edc41538d5da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> hours and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/6/296fac336caaa4265aa24b6ecbc408a348ad7e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. That means it has to be January 1 at 9:31PM or January 2 at 9:31AM because they are the only ones that end with 31. But, the answer can’t be in January 1 because there are 24 hours in a day and 33 is greater than 24. So, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/4/5448a3e0374955ad2ce64b4081f36d5da604fba8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\text{ January 2 at 9:31AM}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"225\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>-RealCXY\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Estimate.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Estimate)\">Solution 3 (Estimate)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Estimate)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The answer choices are relatively far apart, so we can use estimation to solve this problem. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b3e68c5c81df7c15028dd77ace7d5b6b312eca1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2100/60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"65\" height=\"20\" /> is around <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7f6c79f2148f0cec592c9517b40ee1b82ef22e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> hours, or about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/15788e198a53ced87268aea78fcde68a84de92c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> days. The only answer choice around <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/15788e198a53ced87268aea78fcde68a84de92c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> days from the midnight of January 1, 2011 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/d/5ddbaf01a2555e722228adccdf672f9585a87297.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\text{ January 2 at 9:31AM}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"203\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>MegaBoy6679 :D 23:31, 26 December 2022 (EST)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/G4TaNyvDUOQ\">https://youtu.be/G4TaNyvDUOQ</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8\" title=\"2011 AMC 8\">2011 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2011\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a h